        "cooked": "<p>So, Game Center went from being a fantastic social thing to a craptastic \"just have achievements\" thing. BUT i played a game yesterday with a user called CasuallyJesus. Through teamwork, we managed to complete a game that was a sure loss, turn it around with FFAZ, PWAA, ESS, and AGL against Proletariat, Friction, FT, and Ermine. If this was you, PLEASE let me know. I've been looking for you for a day now. we did well.&nbsp;</p>",
